			<abstract>
				<gco:CharacterString>The satellite's multispectral imager provides a versatile set of 13 spectral bands spanning from the visible and near infrared to the shortwave infrared. Some of these bands have been used as training data for the DeepForest Project.</gco:CharacterString>
			</abstract>
			<purpose>
				<gco:CharacterString>Dedicated to supplying data for Copernicus services, Sentinel-2 is carrying a range of technologies, such as multi-spectral imaging instruments for land, ocean and atmospheric monitoring. It's is delivering high-resolution optical images for land monitoring, emergency response and security services. The satellite's multispectral imager provides a versatile set of 13 spectral bands spanning from the visible and near infrared to the shortwave infrared.</gco:CharacterString>
			</purpose>
